you are using modules, the new kernel wants the "module_init_tools" stuff 
instead of the modutils that comes with RH-7.2.  As for the binutils, I have 
been using 2.14.  The last kernel that I built and boots is 2.6.0-test4.  I 
have only tried 2.6.0-test4 it on one machine.  It appears to work OK, for 
me.  You milage may vary.  

I hope this helps.

