Here is an XF86Config (and a log) that is working on a PWS500 running
RedHat
with a Radeon 7500. I am running a newer kernel and I compiled XFree86
also
but that shouldn't matter. Try it if it doesn't work maybe the log will
give you some clues, failing that you could compile XFree 4.2 locally,

Stephen Lewis
